(iii)
Lecturers of Government Law College ;
(iv)
Lecturers of Hindi Teachers Training College ;
(v)
Lecturers of State Institute of Education/State Institute of Science Education ;
(vi)
Deputy Inspector of Schools/District Social Education Officer ;
(2)
The service may also include-
(i)
any post equivalent to a post in any of the cadres mentioned in sub-rule (1): and
(ii)
any cadre or post declared by Government to be a cadre of the service.
Note. - Each of the post in the sub-rule (10 shall form independent cadre. Members of any cadre shall have no claim for
appointment in higher cadre except in accordance with provisions of these rules.
